{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26014","headline":"读史 · 鲍溶","name":"读史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬼书报秦亡，天地亦云闭。\n赤龙吟大野，老[母]哭白帝。\n苍苍无白日，项氏徒先济。\n六合已姓刘，鸿门事难制。\n坑降嬴政在，衣锦人望替。\n宿昔见汉兵，龙蛇满旌棨。\n始矜山可拔，终叹骓不逝。\n区区亚父心，未究天人际。\n萧张马无汗，盛业垂千世。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}